  "body": "Step into a world where every day feels like a getaway. This stunning 2-storey weatherboard home is nestled in a family-friendly area with beautiful lake views.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Appreciate\r\n\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms offering space and flexibility for the whole family.\r\n• Spacious living and dining area designed for everyday convenience and effortless entertaining. \r\n• The sleek, beautifully tiled bathroom with a bathtub is a daily luxury, while a convenient guest powder room on the ground floor adds a thoughtful touch for your visitors.\r\n• A breathable, open-plan modern kitchen with quality appliances; enjoy your cooking at home every day.\r\n• Internal access double garage and additional off-street parking; there’s room for everyone.\r\n• Massive, sun-soaked deck with gorgeous lake view, ideal for BBQs, sunset cocktails, or lazy Sundays with friends and family.\r\n• Easy-care 352 m2 section with private fully fenced backyard; you’ll love the peace & privacy.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\nClose to school, reserves, golf club and local shops. The stunning Shakespear Regional Park is just a short drive away – perfect for walks, picnics, and making cherished memories.\r\n\r\nThis home isn’t just a place to live – it’s a place to thrive. With our vendors already committed to their next chapter, this is your moment.\r\n\r\nCall us now to make it yours before someone else does!",
